This product includes software derived from speech-swift
(https://github.com/soniqo/speech-swift, commit 468db5f29e1304a140e3b8d9bb9ec8f2162c13bc),
Copyright soniqo, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Files under Sources/OmniVoiceMLX/ (backbone, codec encoder/decoder, input builder,
tokenizer wrapper, rule duration estimator) started as copies of
speech-swift Sources/OmniVoiceTTS/ and were modified.

The model architecture, inference algorithm, text front-end, audio pre/post-processing
and the SIM-o speaker-similarity evaluation are ports of k2-fsa OmniVoice
(https://github.com/k2-fsa/OmniVoice, Apache License 2.0). Model weights are not part
of this repository: the MLX bundles aufklarer/OmniVoice-MLX-int8 / -fp16 and the
k2-fsa/TTS_eval_models speaker-similarity checkpoint (WavLM-large + ECAPA-TDNN) are
downloaded separately and remain under their own licenses.

The torchaudio-compatible resampler reproduces torchaudio.functional.resample
(BSD-2-Clause). The silence-removal port reproduces pydub (MIT) semantics.
